xample, It makes this noise.. when it walks. It's a creation essentially So Allah mentions that there are multiple creations like that So there are many things that are from the unseen, meaning they are beings or things: it can be objects, it can be beings, Like it can be the Throne of God, for example, something we've not seen It can be any of these things, like I said, Heaven, Hellfire, it doesn't have to be a living being but there are many things and beings that we have not seen", "and the reason we believe in them is that we believe in what we're told So there are many things of the Unseen World though we're not told about, so we have no clue What these things are but we believe in what we're told because it comes from the Creator So when you say, what is your position on the Unseen? I'm just trying to understand what you mean by \"my position\".",))
