ays: وَمَا هُوَ بِمُزَحْزِحِهِۦ مِنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ أَن يُعَمَّرَ (It is not going to make him move away or run away or escape the punishment..", "that he lives a thousand year) Even if you were to live a thousand years, that does not mean now that you've escaped the punishment So, then, Allah says (Aljumua62:8) \"إِنَّ ٱلْمَوْتَ ٱلَّذِى تَفِرُّونَ مِنْهُ\" (That death that you're running away from..) فَإِنَّهُۥ مُلَـٰقِيكُمْ ۖ (It is going to meet you) The death that you're running away from Then, Allah says ثُمَّ تُرَدُّونَ إِلَىٰ عَـٰلِمِ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ (Then, you'll be returned to the Knower of the seen and the unseen.) فَيُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ (Then, Allah will tell you what you used to do) He will inform you of your actions, those things that you're doing that you think no one sees, Allah sees the seen and the unseen and that death that you're running away from is going to catch you, is going to meet you Everyone watching this video, if you're living a life and you're doing certain things", "and you're not upon your religion, you're not upon your Deen, you're not doing good and you believe that, if you were to die in that state, you're entering Hellfire, then why are you.. If a person like this person here.. who is not a Muslim by the way, –he's a Christian, he's not a Muslim– has changed his life and we know that Christians don't have the Truth –that's a claim we make– and you, a Muslim, you have the Truth and you didn't change your life.. If a person like this person.. he has like 7-8 million subscribers, he's making like hundreds of thousands, millions probably of dollars and he's got the fame, he's got everything..", "and he turned his life even though he doesn't have the Truth, He's following Christianity. And you, as a Muslim, you've not thought the same.. You've not done the same things and you have less pleasures around you and you have less desires around And you have the Truth.. him, death has made him turn his life and you, de