n the afterlife. Meaning, if they give charity, Allah increases their money. He might give them good children. He might give them a good wife. So, Allah can reward them in this life, for the good that they do. Even though they're not doing it for His sake. – But in the afterlife, they didn't do anything for the afterlife, so they get nothing in the afterlife.",))
