ip. The man is the leader in the marriage Of course Women are generally.. they follow the lead of the man. That's why women are not, it's not permissible for them to marry a non-Muslim man So that is one of the purposes for an individual to marry.. it's not for their beauty and all of what certain people do. It's not for that. So yes you can marry her and call her to Islam and no problem Allah has allowed you to do that and the children will listen to you are the the head of the relationship.", "They will take your religion as they do most of the time take the religion of the father.. But! none of that is related to you now brother! None of that is related to you now! Taking that step and dying upon the Truth now. Because that's why I was telling you.. Look! No religion will be accepted from you except Islam and you have to testify with the Truth You know already, I'm sure you already know, you have to say the Shahada, you need to testify with the Truth Allah says (Quran43:86) إِلَّا مَن شَهِدَ بِالْحَقِّ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ “Except those who testify with the Truth knowingly\" So you have to testify with the Truth, u have to say what u believe in your heart; because the Deeds you're doing my brother, I don't want them to go to waste and I don't want you to say in the next year and you're not alive in the next month, and you're not alive in the month after the next month..", "Allahﷻ knows but it has to come from you, look if you are someone who do not know about Islam, I will not tell you to take the Shahada But you're not only someone who knows about Islam, believes in the pillars of Islam, you're someone who's practicing the pillars of Islam every day You're doing probably more than some Muslims. So it would not make any sense for you to.. look, be praying, be doing all of the duaَ as, Be believing in Allah, He's the Only True God, Jesus is only a Prophet of God, believe in the Quran, believe in everything but not taking that step and saying OK I'm going to do that 